    MC @ think "帮忙？你要-"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:904
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_c89dc97f:

    # "米尤 dropped down into her puddle like form once again, crawling toward me quickly as she clambered up through the crevices of my armour."
    "米尤再次变成水洼形态，快速向我爬来，从盔甲的缝隙中钻了进去。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:906
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_c21dc864:

    # MC @ surprised "WHAT ARE YOU-"
    MC @ surprised "你在干什-"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:907
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_ff3394d5:

    # "I could feel 米尤 warmly resting beneath my armour, she was calm, and only lightly shifting beneath me."
    "我能感觉到米尤温暖地蜷缩在盔甲下，她很安静，只是在我身下轻微移动。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:908
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_aaa82b0f:

    # "To the untrained eye, no one would know the difference."
    "在外人看来，根本看不出差别。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:909
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_1c145803:

    # MYU "米尤! 米尤!"
    MYU "米尤！米尤！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:910
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_794ce1cb:

    # MC @ lewd "H-Hey! Easy down there!"
    MC @ lewd "嘿！下面轻点！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:911
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_93cc5246:

    # MYU "米尤... Hide... People... No see."
    MYU "米尤...藏起来...人们...看不见。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:912
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_01091c43:

    # MC "(It's almost alarming how fast she's learning to speak Alderian.)"
    MC "(她学习奥尔德里安语的速度快得惊人。)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:913
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_a4f1e169:

    # MC "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MC "{i}*叹气*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:915
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_22924bcd:

    # MC @ serious "Okay, 米尤, but no coming out till I say, okay?"
    MC @ serious "好吧米尤，但我不说就不能出来，好吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:916
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_61b6bc4f:

    # MYU "Okay!"
    MYU "好的！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:917
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_da78808d:

    # "Beneath all the shifting under my armour, I felt what seemed like a lone tentacle sneakily moving further down than the others."
    "在盔甲下的所有移动中，我感到似乎有一根触手偷偷地比其他触手移动得更往下。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:919
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_2e20f6ad:

    # MC @ talk "米尤... What are you doing?"
    MC @ talk "米尤...你在做什么？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:920
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_3643d5ca:

    # "The tentacle quickly retreated."
    "触手迅速缩了回去。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:921
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_663dc8eb:

    # MYU "{i}...Nothing!{/i}"
    MYU "{i}...没什么！{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:922
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:924
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_5cfca60c:

    # "With 米尤 shuffling beneath my armour, the two of us headed out into the Evening."
    "随着米尤在盔甲下移动，我们两人走进了夜幕中。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:925
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_f6a007ce:

    # "The first thing I did was head into the darkened back streets, away from too many prying eyes where I knew bandits and other unsavoury figures tended to linger."
    "我首先走向昏暗的后街，避开太多窥视的目光，我知道强盗和其他不良分子常在那里徘徊。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:926
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_7275f098:

    # "It didn't take long before I was surrounded by a group of thugs, blades drawn ready."
    "没过多久，我就被一群暴徒包围了，他们亮出了刀刃。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:936
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_60b56d76:

    # THUG "Enjoying a little evening stroll, are we?"
    THUG "享受晚间散步呢，是吧？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:937
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_60f36fe8:

    # THUG "Hand over your coin and we'll let you walk."
    THUG "交出你的钱，我们就放你走。"

# game/data/world_quests/sside/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:938
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_96541c35:

    # MC @ talk "...米尤, are you ready?"
    MC @ talk "...米尤，准备好了吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:939
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_bb741f1e:

    # MYU "..."
    MYU "..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:940
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_db4a1e82:

    # "米尤 said nothing, but I can feel something {i}changing{/i} beneath my armour."
    "米尤什么也没说，但我能感觉到盔甲下有什么正在{i}改变{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:941
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_bf69987f:

    # "She might not have been able to understand all the words said just now, but she could {i}sense{/i} the men before her were hostile, and just like that, her animal instincts kicked in."
    "她可能听不懂刚才的所有话，但她能{i}感知{/i}到面前的男人充满敌意，就这样，她的动物本能被激发了。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:942
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_37060419:

    # "Pouring out of my armour, she re-formed herself in a frightening visage of sharp blades and teeth, snarling at the terrified bandits who immediately began to panic."
    "她从我的盔甲中涌出，重新形成了一个带有锋利刀刃和牙齿的可怕形象，对着惊恐的强盗们咆哮，他们立刻开始恐慌。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:945
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_81f87009:

    # MYU "{i}*Snarls!*{/i}"
    MYU "{i}*咆哮！*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:950
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_d39f0328:

    # THUG "WHAT THE FUCK IS THAT?!"
    THUG "那他妈是什么东西？！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:951
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_74096ffd:

    # THUG "Kill it! KILL IT NOW!"
    THUG "杀了它！现在就杀了它！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:955
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_49fa8301:

    # "As I drew my blade down across the last thug, I turned to see 米尤."
    "当我挥剑砍倒最后一个暴徒时，我转身看向米尤。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:961
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_2cd07a6f:

    # "Having eviscerated one of the bandits into a bloody pulp of flesh and blood, she was dissolving and devouring his flesh."
    "她把一个强盗撕成了血肉模糊的烂泥，正在溶解并吞噬他的血肉。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:962
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_022d254d:

    # "The Blood splatter on her body was absorbed through her skin, and the cute innocence she had conveyed until now was all but gone."
    "溅在她身上的血液通过皮肤被吸收，她至今表现出的可爱天真几乎消失殆尽。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:963
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_fa64eac2:

    # "Only this ghastly nightmare stood before me, lapping up the warm blood like milk."
    "只有这个可怕的噩梦站在我面前，像喝牛奶一样舔舐着温热的血液。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:964
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_c728332a:

    # "One of the bandits still squirmed as she pressed her bladed hand into his body."
    "当一个强盗还在挣扎时，她将刀刃般的手插入他的身体。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:966
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_796deab9:

    # "Small tendrils pushed through his ripped open eye sockets and mouth."
    "细小的触须从他撕裂的眼窝和嘴巴中钻出。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:967
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_011a31cb:

    # "Tentacles tore their way through his body and could be seen shifting about beneath the skin."
    "触手撕裂了他的身体，可以看到在皮肤下移动。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:969
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_cc0c4ed1:

    # "He gargled and choked as the tentacles seemed to puppeteer him briefly till he finally fell still, dead and drained pale white."
    "他发出咯咯声并窒息，触手似乎短暂地操纵着他，直到他最终静止不动，死亡并被吸得苍白。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:970
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_d06fcedc:

    # "For a moment, I considered abandoning this... {i}thing{/i} right here."
    "有一瞬间，我考虑过抛弃这个...{i}东西{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:971
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_fbf28920:

    # "I could escape, let the City Guard handle this {i}monster{/i} standing before me."
    "我可以逃跑，让城市卫队处理我面前的这个{i}怪物{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:973
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_5512e3fe:

    # "米尤, noticing my expression, stopped eating and dragged her way towards me, the voice once again sweet as that innocent face of hers returned."
    "米尤注意到我的表情，停止进食向我爬来，声音再次变得甜美，那天真无邪的脸庞又回来了。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:977
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_2534e2b7:

    # MYU @ sad "We... Go?"
    MYU @ sad "我们...走？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:978
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_f41c9653:

    # MC @ sad "...Y-Yes, we go."
    MC @ sad "...是-是的，我们走。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:982
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_49eba397:

    # "The two of us hurried as we slipped away into the darkness back home before the guards stumbled upon the grizzly scene left in our wake."
    "我们两人匆忙溜进黑暗中的家，赶在守卫发现我们留下的可怕场景之前。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:989
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_4ac8c646:

    # MC @ talk "米尤? What is it?"
    MC @ talk "米尤？怎么了？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:990
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_6010b8f6:

    # MYU @ sad "{i}Why... Look at 米尤 like that...{/i}"
    MYU @ sad "{i}为什么...那样看着米尤...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:991
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_ac3da786:

    # MC @ surprised "Huh?"
    MC @ surprised "嗯？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:992
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_72fee8b8:

    # MYU @ sad "Back in alley..."
    MYU @ sad "在小巷里的时候……"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:993
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_0299ab02:

    # MYU @ sad "Not seen look at me like that before."
    MYU @ sad "以前没人那样看过我。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:994
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_02c4c377:

    # MYU @ sad "Was 米尤 bad?"
    MYU @ sad "米尤坏吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:995
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_69c9834e:

    # MC @ sad "I-"
    MC @ sad "我——"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:996
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_89017916:

    # MC @ sad "No, 米尤, you weren't bad."
    MC @ sad "不，米尤，你不坏。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:997
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_14f50b3f:

    # MC @ talk "I've just never seen you like that before."
    MC @ talk "我只是从未见过你那样。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:998
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_b51439e1:

    # MYU @ sad "Like what?"
    MYU @ sad "什么样？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:999
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_f47d7bb8:

    # MC @ think "Just..."
    MC @ think "只是……"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1000
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_ed3f878c:

    # "I didn't know how to answer her, what {i}could{/i} I say after what I just saw?"
    "我不知道如何回答她，在看到刚才那一幕后，我{i}能{/i}说什么？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1001
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_7d580b52:

    # MC @ smile "米尤, why don't you get some rest?"
    MC @ smile "米尤，你去休息一下吧？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1002
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_11db02de:

    # MC @ smile "Its been a long night."
    MC @ smile "今晚很长。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1003
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_89de05dc:

    # "米尤 nodded softly, making her way towards the bedroom."
    "米尤轻轻点头，向卧室走去。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1007
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_73488014:

    # REGINA @ talk "How did it go?"
    REGINA @ talk "情况如何？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1010
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_46eac9a6:

    # REGINA @ smile "Oh, I just slipped in earlier to see how 米尤 was doing!"
    REGINA @ smile "哦，我刚溜进来看米尤怎么样了！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1011
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_ee978acf:

    # REGINA @ talk "When I noticed she was gone, I figured the two of you must have been {i}out,{/i} so I decided to wait for you."
    REGINA @ talk "当我发现她不见了时，我想你们俩一定是{i}出去了{/i}，所以决定等你们。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1012
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_b1b3ce81:

    # MC @ think "O-Oh, right, of course."
    MC @ think "哦-哦，对，当然。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1016
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_b78cb548:

    # REGINA @ sad "...So, how was it?"
    REGINA @ sad "...那么，情况怎么样？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1017
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_b060895f:

    # MC @ serious "It was... Difficult seeing her do that."
    MC @ serious "看到她那样子...很难受。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1018
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_b0c66fe1:

    # MC @ sad "Like, it felt like I was dealing with another {i}monster.{/i}"
    MC @ sad "就像，感觉我是在对付另一个{i}怪物{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1019
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_07f65605:

    # REGINA @ sad "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    REGINA @ sad "{i}*叹气*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1021
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_1ccd9609:

    # MC @ talk "...Is she safe to keep around?"
    MC @ talk "...留她在身边安全吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1023
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_e3a90034:

    # REGINA @ talk "People have kept and trained slimes before."
    REGINA @ talk "以前有人饲养和训练过史莱姆。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1024
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_f3037070:

    # REGINA @ talk "But its not like keeping a dog."
    REGINA @ talk "但这不像养狗。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1025
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_fa93a8fa:

    # REGINA @ talk "Even if they {i}*can*{/i} speak, they can still switch at a moment's notice."
    REGINA @ talk "即使它们{i}*能*{/i}说话，它们仍可能瞬间转变。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1026
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_84335a2a:

    # MC @ surprised "But, you said she's imprinted on me, right?"
    MC @ surprised "但是，你说她印随了我，对吧？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1027
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_a399f7bc:

    # REGINA @ talk "Doesn't mean she wont attack others if she gets overwhelmed or any number of things could happen..."
    REGINA @ talk "不意味着她不会在不知所措时攻击他人，或者发生任何可能的事情..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1028
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_7821a17c:

    # MC @ talk "Then what should I do with her?"
    MC @ talk "那我该拿她怎么办？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1029
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_9898c219:

    # REGINA @ talk "Just keep an eye on her, that's all."
    REGINA @ talk "看紧她就行了。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1030
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_4d3c2876:

    # REGINA @ talk "Only time will tell."
    REGINA @ talk "只有时间能证明。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1031
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_9d8f7bf6:

    # MC @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MC @ talk "{i}*叹气*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1032
translate zh qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_4f113424:

    # MC @ talk "I need some room."
    MC @ talk "我需要静一静。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:1039
